  "decisions": [
    "Use original README season convention: year starts November; adult count is breeding pairs, chick count is creched chicks.",
    "Read semicolon CSV with decimal commas; missing values remain missing. Author code aggregates nonmissing counts by merged code/year. Strict alternative also requires all hyphen-separated original labels covered exactly once by observed counts, excludes cross-unit label membership.",
    "Common years require at least one adult count per island; excluded 2006 and 2010 lack Bernard adults, 2013 and 2016 have no adult or chick counts in this archive. Do not substitute zeros.",
    "Fixed roster is determined from completeness, not trend. Subset of observed colonies, not whole island. Coverage rule depends on source label semantics, not measured GIS polygons. No independent site replication across islands.",
